<title>LATVIA: CENTRAL BANK DEPO RATE UNCHANGED AT 1.5 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK DEPO RATE UNCHANGED AT 1.5 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvia's central bank said on Wednesday that its 33-day deposit rate remained unchanged at 1.5 percent.</p>
<p>The bank will accept deposits at this rate on June 30 for 33 days and the repayment date will be July 31, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Riga nerwsoom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
